{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"content_hash":"a3498fbe138d8150ef638e096fc3b12f7bcf400a13d8c530ac611b8d2779fba4","digest":{"component_or_area":"Jira outbound comment sync reconciler","key_entities":["comment_ids","RECONCILER_MARKER","reconcile-bridge.yml","outbound_comments.py","_normalize_comment_body","_decorate_outbound_comment","_TRUNCATION_SUFFIX","adapters/jira/comment_limits.py","COMMENTS_PER_ISSUE_LIMIT_EXCEEDED","712020:6471376f-4e5e-4ed2-8c05-330827bc387e","REB-1861","bd80-0603-7d44-4d9f","irongrey-chubby-oxpecker","run 32403944666"],"problem_keywords":["duplicate comments","jira sync","comment deduplication","outbound sync","data cleanup"],"propositions":["The primary comment-id dedup map is inert/empty, causing the outbound comment sync to re-post duplicate comments on every hourly reconciliation pass.","The affected-issue set contains exactly 30 Jira issues with ~30,011 duplicate comments accumulated before the reconcile-bridge workflow was paused.","REB-1861 is pinned at Jira's 5000-comment hard cap, blocking new comments until duplicates are purged.","Comment deletion must detect bot-authored echoes via the pre-strip rendered text marker, apply oldest-kept deduplication per normalized body, and handle rate-limiting with explicit 429/Retry-After retry logic.","836 additional truncated comments across three issues lack the marker due to outbound truncation cutting off the marker paragraph, and require separate evidence-gated phase-2 handling."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1787268184114745040,"uuid":"8ae930c7-acdf-40eb-b51d-7cf6c38900db"}